.TH "RTCTRANSPORTSTATS.ICEROLE" "3JS" "June 20, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
RTCTransportStats.iceRole \- RTCTransportStats: iceRole property
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]iceRole\f[B]\f[R] property of the
\f[CR]RTCTransportStats\f[R] dictionary is a string that indicates the
ICE role that the transport is fulfilling: that of the controlling
agent, or the agent that is being controlled.
.PP
This has the same value as the \f[CR]RTCIceTransport.role\f[R] property
of the underlying \f[CR]RTCDtlsTransport.iceTransport\f[R].
.SH VALUE
A string that will be one of the following values:
\f[CR]controlled\f[R], \f[CR]controlling\f[R], or \f[CR]unknown\f[R].
